{"4327620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEWORLD AURALIS", "steam_appid": 4327620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AURALIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story from DEWORLD — a world where reality bends under the influence of human consciousness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A month ago, an industrial village stopped responding. <br>The ore processing plant continued operating — at least on the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The plant remained the same on the outside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>Inside — not at all.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The residents — even less so.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an agent of a secret division dealing with what does not conform to the norms of reality.<br>Mission — inspection and report.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short linear experience in which you must traverse the levels of a facility altered by those who remained inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Several distinct levels<br>• Running and jumping across hazardous structures<br>• Traps and unstable zones<br>• No puzzles or complex systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“The water here reflects not what it should”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327620/extras/c03d1c93e286a3aa4e70a401cb46d10a.avif?t=1786293339\" width=1560 height=335 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AURALIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story from DEWORLD — a world where reality bends under the influence of human consciousness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A month ago, an industrial village stopped responding. <br>The ore processing plant continued operating — at least on the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The plant remained the same on the outside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>Inside — not at all.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The residents — even less so.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an agent of a secret division dealing with what does not conform to the norms of reality.<br>Mission — inspection and report.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short linear experience in which you must traverse the levels of a facility altered by those who remained inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Several distinct levels<br>• Running and jumping across hazardous structures<br>• Traps and unstable zones<br>• No puzzles or complex systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“The water here reflects not what it should”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327620/extras/c03d1c93e286a3aa4e70a401cb46d10a.avif?t=1786293339\" width=1560 height=335 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The village was alive. The factory was running. Then they found something. Now inside remains only what they believed in… and what their madness became.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, Ukrainian, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Kazakh<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327620/ef6853f9e34db36fc2dcd0db44e2f203ad80464e/header.jpg?t=1786293339", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327620/f9f393f9c1acb9be2b1bcb5adbc